    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16036" root="رغم" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُغَامَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A thing that one desires,</i> or <i>seeks;</i> (JK,
K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْغَمَةٌ</span></b> : (TA:) so in the saying,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِى عِنْدَهُ رُغَامَةٌ</span> (JK, TA) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْغَمَةٌ</span> (TA) [<i>I
have a thing that I desire,</i> or <i>seek, to obtain from
such a one</i>].

